 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's trade balance with the United States in 2025 shows a deficit, with exports at 421.0 million euros and imports at 638.1 million euros.",
  "Exports decreased slightly by 0.9% from 424.8 million euros in 2024 to 421.0 million euros in 2025.",
  "Imports fell more significantly by 6.6%, from 683.1 million euros in 2024 to 638.1 million euros in 2025.",
  "This data reflects nominal values and does not account for price changes over time.",
  "The main limitation is that values are in current euros and are not adjusted for inflation or other price changes."
